{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受词仍然偏密，尤其S01、S05等短停留段，纵向切换较多，容易让观众忙于扫字。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但【】突出关键心理节点，观众能迅速抓住每段叙事的核心；而且感受词有些随音乐小节出现，既保留了细腻的音乐变化，也让人物从害怕暴露需要、因对方接纳而放松，到渴望亲近、害怕失去、最终不再隐藏心意的过程更完整。Y的左右分栏确实更容易扫读，叙事句也更口语流畅，但部分音乐细节、心理转折和情绪层次被压缩了，个别感受词还略显概念化，因此整体表现我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "913d8a24-622c-40a9-a5ef-aeb166f21c17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043021191743Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:31:17.039206+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0849a3b38d7aaaf089dfe78aef9084b548990f2912d58d0c443743fe7b7202bb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen